      "updated": 1766606451514,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "攻击",
      "fontSize": 72.11696860519133,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "攻击",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "J7QpI9W2_LS3GipRtE1VD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1221.175490684962,
      "y": -41.150729173662626,
      "width": 2163.2998046875,
      "height": 270.4386322694675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1461648316,
      "version": 325,
      "versionNonce": 2027503676,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606451514,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "国家和个人之间都是这样的，\n所以非常亲密的人在遇到重大外界影响的时候也会放弃要保护的人\n当一个强大的国家遇到一个更强大的攻击时也会放弃他所保护的国家",
      "fontSize": 72.11696860519133,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "国家和个人之间都是这样的，\n所以非常亲密的人在遇到重大外界影响的时候也会放弃要保护的人\n当一个强大的国家遇到一个更强大的攻击时也会放弃他所保护的国家",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-C1OZtcsyM_Drb3Zyishh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1362.0476535816406,
      "y": 1203.320086069849,
      "width": 1153.7598876953125,
      "height": 90.14621075648917,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 767566908,
      "version": 445,
      "versionNonce": 210170244,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606451514,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "所以永远不要相信别人，永远靠自己",
      "fontSize": 72.11696860519133,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "所以永远不要相信别人，永远靠自己",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ssfrV1_4zeYBzq2cm7uVh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1782.8247025930323,
      "y": 87.07117430941011,
      "width": 2235.409912109375,
      "height": 90.14621075648917,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1955415160,
      "version": 445,
      "versionNonce": 1340360200,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767044427360,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果美国通过别的国家打仗，交易军火，吸收别国经济，可以控制世界",
      "fontSize": 72.11696860519133,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果美国通过别的国家打仗，交易军火，吸收别国经济，可以控制世界",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
