      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "语言学习本质上学的是符号背后的信息，而不是语言本身",
      "fontSize": 47.73332519531268,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "语言学习本质上学的是符号背后的信息，而不是语言本身",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wwAZMj0SG64cWcgdbnAOe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1573.9712344398206,
      "y": -2981.6326522463633,
      "width": 1207.449951171875,
      "height": 79.44447835286452,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 408472056,
      "version": 93,
      "versionNonce": 475063032,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767902128900,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "原始社会，十个人的生产力能养活二十个人",
      "fontSize": 63.55558268229162,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原始社会，十个人的生产力能养活二十个人",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "644XyFDF84HXRlc5lwYJV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1573.9712344398206,
      "y": -2883.8549422854258,
      "width": 1525.199951171875,
      "height": 79.44447835286452,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b40",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1142387192,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 599498488,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767902106523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "工业社会，十个人的生产力能养活一百个人，人口增加",
      "fontSize": 63.55558268229162,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "工业社会，十个人的生产力能养活一百个人，人口增加",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pFrrnt2kFp9O6ziYIvqgk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1573.9712344398206,
      "y": -2783.8549422854217,
      "width": 1666.344482421875,
      "height": 79.44447835286452,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b41",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1796680440,
      "version": 119,
      "versionNonce": 1865008120,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767902128900,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AI社会，十个人的生产力可以养活一千个人，人口继续增加",
      "fontSize": 63.55558268229162,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AI社会，十个人的生产力可以养活一千个人，人口继续增加",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rEH6hoCBT6YFo2zBL08wD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1573.9712344398206,
      "y": -3120.7993189130275,
      "width": 1051.5559082031252,
      "height": 50.55557250976562,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
